From a6f1d9e1ae4820ba873438cb035b525b4fa81657 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josep Torra <n770galaxy@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:00:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] tests/sgxfive: add render node tests

Test the sgxfive UAPI without GPU programs: DEV_QUERY contents and size
rules, BO creation and CPU mappings, VM_MAP/VM_UNMAP rules, transfer
context creation, and SUBMIT_JOBS with dummy transfers: binary and
timeline syncobjs, several contexts, the job limit, versioned strides
and every validation rule, including that a failing call runs nothing
and reports the job that failed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Josep Torra <n770galaxy@gmail.com>
---
